[Intro]

[Verse 1]
[00:39.65]We rode beyond the line of pines
[00:43.92]Where the birch doth shrink and bow
[00:48.40]Where the moss is the height of the reindeer's knee
[00:53.21]And the river runneth from the snow

[00:57.63]There be no night here, only light
[01:00.08]A sky that doth not close its eye
[01:02.71]The sun is a wolf upon the world
[01:04.83]And the wolf shall never lie

[Pre-Chorus]
[01:10.05]Beaivi, beaivi
[01:11.40]Sól eigi sefr
[01:12.26]Beaivi, beaivi
[01:13.42]The sun that doth not sleep

[Chorus]
[01:18.91]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[01:21.27]Where the day doth never end!
[01:23.88]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[01:26.09]We are wild and we are free!
[01:28.23]The road doth runneth without an end
[01:30.53]The light doth runneth in our veins
[01:33.25]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[01:35.52]Skål to the year that knoweth no night!

[Verse 2]
[01:48.95]Older folk than ours did walk this ground
[01:51.92]Older songs than ours did rise
[01:53.75]They drum a drum we did not bring
[01:56.04]They sing what the wind doth know

[01:58.49]We walk with quiet upon their land
[02:00.85]We bow before the elder fire
[02:03.11]We share the bread, we share the horn
[02:05.44]And the long light maketh us as one

[Pre-Chorus]
[02:07.99]Beaivi, beaivi
[02:09.00]Sól eigi sefr
[02:10.24]Beaivi, beaivi
[02:12.15]The sun that doth not sleep

[Chorus]
[02:17.06]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[02:19.02]Where the day doth never end!
[02:21.66]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[02:23.56]We are wild and we are free!
[02:26.14]The road doth runneth without an end
[02:28.34]The light doth runneth in our veins
[02:30.84]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[02:33.14]Skål to the year that knoweth no night!

[Bridge]
[03:04.91]And the joik that is older than our songs
[03:09.12]Doth sing the sun where the sun doth go
[03:14.02]And the drum that is older than our drums
[03:18.25]Doth speaketh of what we did not know

[03:23.16]We are guests upon the long bright land
[03:27.61]We taketh nothing we cannot give
[03:32.20]Heyr oss, Skogarmóðir of the north
[03:36.95]Where thy daughters teach us how to live

[03:44.55]Beaivi! Beaivi! Beaivi! Beaivi!
[03:49.24]Náttlaus! Náttlaus! Sól eigi sefr!

[Final Chorus]
[03:59.90]Where the sun doth walk the whole night through!
[04:01.95]Where the day doth never end!
[04:04.49]Geassi! Geassi! Náttlaus sól!
[04:06.96]We are wild and we are free!
[04:08.99]The road doth runneth without an end
[04:11.38]The light doth runneth in our veins
[04:13.94]Beaivi! Beaivi! Skál til day!
[04:16.55]Skål to the year that knoweth no night!

[Outro]
